        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Lancia Rally 037, Lancia Rally, Lancia 037, Lancia-Abarth #037\n- Companies: Lancia, Abarth, Fiat, Opel, Audi, Porsche, Ford, BMW\n- People: Walter Röhrl\n- Events: FIA Group B World Rally Championship\n- Concepts: mid-engine sports car, rally car, project code Tipo 151, project code 037\n\nFacts:\n- In the early 1980s, Lancia built the Lancia Rally, also known as the Lancia Rally 037, Lancia 037, and Lancia-Abarth #037, to compete in the FIA Group B World Rally Championship.\n- The Lancia Rally had the project designation Tipo 151 and the Abarth project code 037.\n- The Lancia Rally was a mid-engine sports car and rally car.\n- Walter Röhrl was born on 7 March 1947.\n- Walter Röhrl is a German rally and auto racing driver.\n- Walter Röhrl earned victories for Fiat, Opel, Lancia, Audi, Porsche, Ford, and BMW.",
